Traps and centaurs are good sources of arrows.  I suspect what
you really need is how to keep them from disappearing rapidly.
Blessing them and maxing outluck does that.

Disappearing arrows is why so many players prefer daggers for
classes that can reach expert in them.  For samurai I'll max out
dagger luck before starting to advance bow for this very reason.
By the time I have maxed out dagger blessing and luck aren't
large hurdles any more.  The same strategy should work fine for
rangers.


